// # website/docs — Package Manual
//
// Logline: RFC-0005 docs for the website repo. Live home is index.html.
//
// Setup: No caps. GitHub Pages serves index.html as the public home.
//        There is no hash route and no /docs/*.oot fetch.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Home is static index.html. Constellation includes cli.
//   2. Sibling repos own their own docs/. This site does not mirror them.
//   3. website and .github are table-only. Brand is home.
